  "details": "My avatar was originally designed around excluding the knee transforms to reduce component usage on the skirt. However, due to PhysBone conversion, for some reason the SDK made three PhysBone components per leg, which left me confused. \nI tried to set the transforms to the thighs and exclude the knees, but this resulted in the Wobblylegs issue: not even excluding all the other transforms included fixed this issue. \nAlso, for reference, this is a case where setting the multi-bone property to First or Ignore isn’t applicable for rigging reasons.",
